

###########################
Helm Defination?
###########################
Helm is considered to be a package manager for k8s which allows us to install k8s controllers and third party applications 
using helm, we can install, update, uninstall, bundle applications as helm chart so that anyone outside org can use it 

###########################
Helm Chart ?
###########################
chart is bundle/package of your application , chars are stored in repository. A chart is a helm package. It Contains resource definitions necessary to run application, tool , service etc

###########################
Helm Repo ?
###########################
Helm repository is a collection of chats, Charts are stored in helm repo 

###########################
Helm Release?
###########################
Helm Release is a running instance of helm chart. It is like a snapshot, every change made is stored 

