Difference b/n helm 2 & helm 3 - 

Helm 2 was a client server architecture & used tiller . Tiller is the middle man. It had security concerns 
Tiller was running in god mode , it had all access. It was able to make any changes in the k8s cluster. 

Tiller was sitting between us and k8s, it was creating complexity and security concerns. It had privileges to do everything. 

Once RBAC/ CRD [ Custom Resource Defination ] came to picture, need for tiller  has gone  / removed in helm 3. 


Helm 3 - Tiller is removed , RBAC got introduced, more security 

3 - Way Strategic Merge patch -  helm 2 misses it , helm 3 has it. 
Previous chart / current chart / live state - helm 3 check all of them 


New revision is created whenever we do any action such as install/update/rollback  using helm. Helm2 was less sophisticated with rollback . Manual changes are not tracked. 

for Helm 3 , it  also take care  of live state,  manual changes are  tracked   




